<p>HAAYE HUSSAIN asws., ***3</p>

<p>NARGAYE AADA MEIN HAI SHABBIR asws., AKELA.</p>

<p>1. JALTI HUI QAAK PE ZEHRA sa., KA PISAR HAI.</p>

<p>JISM MEIN PAIWAST SABHI TEER O TABAR HAI.</p>

<p>QOON MEIN TAR HAAYE MUHAMMED KA JIGAR HAI.</p>

<p>DASHT MEIN SAR PEET KE ROTI RAHI ZEHRA sa.,</p>

<p>
2. TEER KABHI TEGH KABHI BARCHIYA&rsquo;N KHAYI.</p>

<p>SANIYE ZEHRA sa., NE YEH FARYAAD SUNAYI.</p>

<p>KOI BHI IMDAD KO AATA NAHI BHAYI.</p>

<p>JAO MADAD KE LIYE ABBAS asws., QUDARA.</p>

<p>
