<p>SATH MEIN BETI BHI KHADI DEKH RAHI HAI.</p>

<p>HAAYE RE BE DEEN KI KYA BE ADABI HAI.</p>

<p>KAAT-KE SAR SHIMR NE ZULFO&rsquo;N SE UTHAYA.</p>

<p>
5. AIK ANGOOTHI KE LIYE ZILM WO DHAYAD.</p>

<p>KAATKE UNGLI DIL E ZEHRA sa., KO RULAYA.</p>

