<p>DEKHKE BHAYI KO YEH ZAINAB sa., NE PUKARA&#8230; HAAYE HUSSAIN asws.</p>

<p>
7. SAIF HAI MAGHMOOM GHAME SHAHE HUDA MEIN.</p>

<p>AAJ KUMAIL ASGHARI WALE HAI AZA MEIN.</p>

<p>SANI E ZEHRA sa., BHI HAI MASROOF BUKA MEIN.</p>

<p>AAQRI DAM TAK YAHI ZAINAB sa., KA THA NAUHA.</p>